1461	    // ---------- consumers ----------
1462	    // NOTE: tried lifting the consumer to 240 by ceding the producer to 24 (256*240+128*24 = the 64512
1463	    // pool) -- it regressed broadly (gqa 0.91->0.87, large4k 0.82->0.78): the TMA producer needs its 40
1464	    // regs to issue/schedule ahead, and starving it stalls the whole ring. Consumer stays at 232.
